title: The Expelled
subtitle: The Left Radical districts leave the party.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1919 and month >= 11 and crisis = 0 and heidelberg_outcome = 1 and e19_split_done = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 2

= The Expelled

[? if heid_already = 0 : The Zentrale's emissaries have taken the congress's decision to Hamburg, Bremen and Berlin. Hamburg votes almost to a man to stay with Laufenberg and Wolffheim. In Berlin the old district committee takes the offices with it. In Dresden Rühle declares that the time of parties is over. ?][? if heid_already = 1 : Now that Heidelberg has closed the door, the last sympathisers of the Left Radicals in our districts are choosing sides. ?]

The expelled call themselves the opposition, and say that the real Communist Party is the one the Zentrale threw out. How many members go with them depends on how we fight for the rest.

- @rebuild: Send loyal secretaries to rebuild the lost districts.
- @door: Keep the door open for the workers who left.
- @fight: Fight them for every factory.

@rebuild
subtitle: New committees from Berlin. Most of the members will go anyway.
on-arrival: {! Q.heid_split_share = Math.min(Q.heid_split_share, 0.72); Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1; !}
go-to: exodus

@door
subtitle: No insults, and a way back. More will stay, and the opposition will stay friendly.
on-arrival: {! Q.heid_split_share = Math.min(Q.heid_split_share, 0.66); Q.kapd_relation += 20; Q.lean_unionist += 1; !}
go-to: exodus

@fight
subtitle: Hard and loud in every workplace. The most members kept, and an enemy for years.
on-arrival: {! Q.heid_split_share = Math.min(Q.heid_split_share, 0.6); Q.kapd_relation -= 15; Q.lean_offensive += 2; !}
go-to: exodus

@exodus
title: After the Split
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var share = Q.heid_split_share;
var lost = 0;
var names = [];
var heirs = {
    berlin: (Q.heid_left == 1) ? 'offensive' : 'luxemburgist',
    hamburg: 'offensive',
    bremen: 'luxemburgist',
    ruhr: 'offensive'
};
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    var key = 'district_' + d;
    if (Q[key + '_faction'] == 'ultraleft') {
        var l = Q[key + '_members'] * share;
        lost += l;
        names.push(Q.district_names[d]);
        Q[key + '_members'] -= l;
        Q[key + '_faction'] = heirs[d] || Q.leading_faction;
        Q[key + '_loyalty'] = 50;
    } else {
        var l2 = Q[key + '_members'] * 0.08;
        lost += l2;
        Q[key + '_members'] -= l2;
    }
}
Q.heid_members_lost = lost.toFixed(1);
Q.heid_lost_names = names.length > 1 ? names.slice(0, -1).join(", ") + " and " + names[names.length - 1] : (names[0] || "the opposition districts");
Q.ultraleft_gone = 1;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction = 0;
Q.lean_ultraleft = 0;
if (Q.junior_faction == 'ultraleft') { Q.junior_faction = 0; }
Q.kapd_split = 1;
Q.e19_split_done = 1;
Q.worker_support -= 3;
Q.unity += 15;
RG.districtSync();
for (var d2 of ['hamburg', 'bremen', 'berlin']) { RG.district(d2, {militancy: -5}); }
RG.news('Expelled Left Radicals take ' + Q.heid_lost_names + ' with them', 3);
RG.ledger('The split after Heidelberg cost the party about ' + Q.heid_members_lost + ' thousand members.', 'e19_split');
!}

= After the Split

By the end of the year the party has lost about **[+ heid_members_lost +] thousand** members. [? if heid_already = 0 : Most of the members in [+ heid_lost_names +] have gone over to the opposition. ?] Those who stay accept the theses.

The opposition will hold its own congress in the spring and call itself the Communist Workers' Party. For now it is a rival for the same workers, in the same factories, under the same red flags.
